  "labour_method": "Labour = migrant workers' remittances. Pre-war years: total minus a small non-labour part. 2022 on: the part explained by the 2019-2021 level x Russian average wage in USD x migrant numbers, checked against BoP personal remittances; surpluses that coincide with relocation (2022-23 ARM, GEO, KAZ, AZE, UZB) or that wages cannot explain (TJK 2022, 2024-25) go to relocant_eur_bn, which therefore means \"relocants, capital and other non-labour\".",
