  "money_rule": "counted = change x value_kept x extra. Use product_when_more when labour is above the expected level, product_when_less when below. change ranges: labour and expected ranges summed over 2022-2026 (years fully correlated within a series), then combined in quadrature (independent). Money-rule low pairs a negative change with the high factor.",
